# Package F "Ecto": Lou hires you. Flags: JobAccepted(ecto), ecto_paid, ecto_bribed.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('ecto_paid')
goto: Done

cond: HasFlag('ecto_bribed')
goto: Bribed

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(ecto)') && HasItem('holo_emitter')
goto: Return

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(ecto)')
goto: Waiting

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: My club's haunted. Lights, voices, a face in the mirror. My last manager they found in a cupboard, skinny as a rake. Nobody comes anymore.
#
o_text: Ghosts aren't real.
o_id: ecto_accept
o_goto: Accepted
#
o_text: Not my kind of job.
o_id: ecto_decline
o_goto: Bye

name: Accepted
npc: That's what I need you to prove. Somebody's running a projector on my club. The signal comes from the east side, a kid called Pixel. Bring me whatever runs it. Three-fifty.
effect: SetFlag('JobAccepted(ecto)')
effect: EndConversation

name: Waiting
npc: The east side. Pixel. Make the ghost go away.
effect: EndConversation

name: Return
npc: (He turns the emitter over.) That's it? A box? I went white over a box?
#
o_text: (Hand it over.) 350 sat, as agreed.
o_id: ecto_give
o_goto: Paid
#
o_text: Not yet.
o_id: ecto_keep
o_goto: Bye

name: Paid
npc: Three-fifty. I'm opening tonight. Come by, the drinks are on the ghost.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'holo_emitter', 1)
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'gold', 350)
effect: SetFlag('ecto_paid')
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribed
npc: The ghost was back last night. Louder. I thought you were a professional.
effect: EndConversation

name: Done
npc: No ghosts tonight. Just paying customers.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: Stay out of the mirrors.
effect: EndConversation
